      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗馬爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How is that? The crowded city of Prontera is good, but why don't you go our heaven of the cats, ^A2314BMalangdo^000000?",
      "translation" : "怎麼樣？人來人往的普隆德拉固然不錯，但要不要去我們貓的天堂——^A2314B綿綿島^000000看看？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why don't you go to ^A2314BMalangdo^000000? That place is better than Geffen, where there are only crowds of simple honest wizards.",
      "translation" : "要不要去^A2314B綿綿島^000000看看？那裡可比吉芬好多了，吉芬滿大街都是老實巴交的巫師。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The fresh air of Payon is not bad, but why don't you go better place like the heaven of the cats, ^A2314BMalangdo^000000?",
      "translation" : "斐揚的空氣固然清新，但要不要去更好的地方——貓的天堂^A2314B綿綿島^000000看看？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@s$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "{0}The beautiful and quiet place is better than Aldebaran, where it's so noisy with the tick-tock sound of the clock.",
      "translation" : "{0}那個美麗寧靜的地方，可比整天滴答滴答響個不停的艾爾帕蘭好多了。"
