      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Anyway, I got you. Whenever you want to go, just tell me.",
      "translation" : "行吧，我知道了。想去的時候隨時告訴我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
