      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗馬爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ok! I like your attitude. Full of passion.",
      "translation" : "好！我喜歡你的態度，充滿熱情。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗馬爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now, before you go ^A2314BMalangdo^000000, let me give you some warnings.",
      "translation" : "在你去^A2314B綿綿島^000000之前，我先提醒你幾件事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗馬爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "First!! It is natural that when you arrive on ^A2314BMalangdo^000000, you should notify ^9E1837Admiral Tomas^000000 that you are here.",
      "translation" : "第一！！抵達^A2314B綿綿島^000000後，當然要通知^9E1837托馬斯提督^000000你已經到了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗馬爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you don't do that, you might be attacked by scary and wild cats when you walk through dark streets.",
      "translation" : "如果你不這麼做，走在昏暗的街道上時，可能會遭到兇猛野貓襲擊。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗馬爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Secondly!! This ^A2314BMalangdo^000000 is absolutely our island of cats, even though we open to humans.",
      "translation" : "第二！！^A2314B綿綿島^000000絕對是我們貓咪的島嶼，雖然也對人類開放。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗馬爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We have a personality... no... no... respect us like one catality because we are cats.",
      "translation" : "我們有個性...不...不...因為我們是貓，要像尊重一個貓類那樣尊重我們。"
