      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ok! Do not bite two mice with one mouth. ^9E1837Admiral Tomas^000000 is located at the ^A2314Bcenter of the ship in Malangdo^000000.",
      "translation" : "好！一張嘴可別同時咬兩隻老鼠。^9E1837托馬斯提督^000000就在^A2314B綿綿島船隻的中央^000000。"
