      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^9E1837Admiral Tomas^000000 said to kidnap humans... No... Bring them politely?",
      "translation" : "^9E1837托馬斯提督^000000說要把人類綁架過去...不對...是禮貌地請過去？"
