      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Uh? You must be the one from last time...? Alright. Did you visit ^A2314BMalangdo^000000?",
      "translation" : "嗯？你是上次來的那位嗎...?好吧。你去過^A2314B綿綿島^000000了嗎？"
